.TP
\fB\-\-include\-no\-data\fR \fI<value>\fR
Include customers we hold nothing about beyond their identifier. Defaults to false. One of: true, false. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\-by\fR \fI<value>\fR
lastSeenAt (the default), firstSeenAt, conversationCount, voiceCount, chatCount, talkTimeMs or displayName, or field.<key> (for example field.COMPANY) to sort by a field's value. Field keys come from GET /v1/customer/fields. Customers without a value sort last. Optional.
.TP
